$('exportGLB').onclick=guards(async()=>{playing=false;banner('正在导出每镜头的机位与独立动画…');const root=new T.Scene();for(const o of content.children)root.add(cloneModel(o));const schedule=shotSchedule(spec),animations=[];root.userData.visualagent_shot_sequence=schedule;root.userData.playback_note='Each shot has its own camera and local animation. Switch cameras in sequence; do not interpolate across cuts.';for(const [j,s]of spec.shots.entries()){const cam=new T.PerspectiveCamera(s.camera.fov,ratio(),.05,200);cam.name=schedule[j].camera;root.add(cam);const times=[],positions=[],rotations=[];for(let i=0;i<=120;i++){const t=s.duration*i/120;poseAt(s,t,cam);times.push(t);positions.push(...cam.position.toArray());rotations.push(...cam.quaternion.toArray())}poseAt(s,0,cam);animations.push(new T.AnimationClip(schedule[j].animation,s.duration,[new T.VectorKeyframeTrack(cam.name+'.position',times,positions),new T.QuaternionKeyframeTrack(cam.name+'.quaternion',times,rotations)]))}const glb=await new GLTFExporter().parseAsync(root,{binary:true,animations,onlyVisible:true});download(glb,'VisualAgent-scene.glb','model/gltf-binary');banner('GLB 已导出 · 每镜头独立机位和动画；镜头顺序保存在场景信息与 JSON 中')});
async function captureFrame(at,overview=false){cameraAt(at);helpers.visible=false;transform.getHelper().visible=false;const render=new T.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});try{render.toneMapping=T.ACESFilmicToneMapping;const a=ratio();render.setSize(a>=1?1280:720,a>=1?Math.round(1280/a):Math.round(720/a));const frameCamera=overview?view.clone():camera;if(overview){frameCamera.aspect=a;frameCamera.updateProjectionMatrix()}render.render(scene,frameCamera);const blob=await new Promise(resolve=>render.domElement.toBlob(resolve,'image/png'));if(!blob)throw Error('预演帧导出失败');return blob}finally{render.dispose();render.forceContextLoss()}}
